  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>The Heavy Repeating Blaster is a fearsome weapon typically operated from a bunker emplacement, or mounted on a combat <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a>. The Heavy Repeating Blaster operates only in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> mode. If you use a Heavy Repeating Blaster without a tripod or other mount, you cannot <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Brace\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brace\">Brace</a> the weapon before making an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attack. </p><p>A Heavy Repeating Blaster requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 10 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. This weapon can also be attached to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Generator\" title=\"Power Generator\">Power Generator</a> for longer use. </p>",
